# 🔍 COMPREHENSIVE APPLICATION AUDIT & STRATEGIC PLAN

**Last Updated:** January 17, 2025  
**Status:** 📊 **COMPLETE DEEP-DIVE AUDIT** - Full application mapping, product.mdc analysis, and strategic roadmap

---

## 📊 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

This document provides a comprehensive audit of the CrisPRO.ai application structure, analyzing 49 pages, 400+ components, 120+ data files, and their interconnections. It maps the current implementation against the product doctrine (`product.mdc`) to identify gaps, opportunities, and a strategic implementation plan.

### 🎯 Key Findings:

**Strengths:**
- ✅ **Strong technical foundation** - SAE components fully modularized, Evidence framework robust, Co-Pilot architecture flexible
- ✅ **Excellent educational content** - Cancer 101, Doctrine system, Learn modules with interactive components
- ✅ **Comprehensive metrics and validation data** - 6 dedicated metric pages, extensive validation data
- ✅ **Multiple use cases demonstrating value** - Multiple Myeloma case study with real metrics
- ✅ **No src2 directory** - Previous audit concern resolved, single codebase
- ✅ **Well-structured data layer** - 110+ component imports from @/data/, clear separation of concerns
- ✅ **Adapter pattern for cross-engine data** - `oracle-adapter.ts`, `forge-adapter.ts`, `platform-adapter.ts` provide clean data transformation
- ✅ **SAE components extracted and modularized** - 24 files in `/components/sae/` with data/utils/types separation

**Critical Problems:**
- ❌ **Gap between product.mdc vision and current implementation** - 90% of capabilities from product.mdc are not visible on website
- ❌ **Lack of clear product direction** - Homepage shows only 4 sections (Hero, Metrics, Interactive Demo, CTA) with 17+ commented components
- ❌ **Confusing navigation** - "In-Silico" vs "Platform" vs "Evidence" vs "Products" - unclear taxonomy
- ❌ **Product pages are basic data dumps** - Oracle, Forge, Boltz pages are just API listings with no compelling narrative
- ❌ **Co-Pilots are scattered** - No unified "Clinical Decision Support" hub showcasing the flagship "Unified Care Plan"
- ❌ **Missing customer journey** - No clear path from "I have this problem" → "CrisPRO solves it" → "See it in action" → "Get started"
- ❌ **SAE features buried** - Powerful SAE components exist but not prominently featured as core differentiator
- ❌ **Redundant/incomplete pages** - investors/, partners/, decks/, agents/, poster/, visualization-demo/, desci/ add noise
- ❌ **No unified care plan showcase** - The #1 capability from product.mdc (Clinical Decision Support) is nowhere to be seen
- ❌ **No SAE explainability in product pages** - Oracle doesn't show SAE features, missing "transparent AI" narrative

