3. **Treatment Line Intelligence** - Sequencing guidance (L1/L2/L3) with cross-resistance
4. **Toxicity Risk Prevention** - Life-threatening toxicity prevention (DPYD/TPMT/UGT1A1/CYP2D6)
5. **Proactive Resistance Detection** - Predict resistance BEFORE they happen
6. **CA-125 Intelligence** - Early resistance detection (3-6 weeks faster than imaging)
7. **Clinical Trial Matching** - Top 10 trials with transparent eligibility reasoning
8. **SOC Recommendations** - NCCN-aligned treatment plans
