12. **Biomarker-Aware Recommendations** - Shared biomarkers (HRD+, TMB, TP53)
13. **SAE Explainability** - Transparent confidence breakdown with provenance
14. **Honest Limitations** - "Awaiting NGS" messaging instead of fake predictions
15. **Clinician-Ready Dossiers** - Action-ready one-pagers with contacts
16. **NGS Fast-Track** - Parallel ctDNA/HRD orders

