- ❌ **No CA-125 intelligence** - Not implemented
- ❌ **No NGS fast-track guidance** - Not visible

**Where to Implement:**
- **Create:** `/solutions/clinical-decision-support/page.tsx` - Flagship hub
- **Enhance:** `/platform/[coPilotSlug]` pages with SAE explainability
